Addition
- [N1] Added trace (model 1): init(i1) -> action(n1,"start") -> action(n2,"select a filter") -> action(n3,"apply the selected filter") -> action(n4,"click on Submit button") -> action(n5,"is option to submit false") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> action(n6,"apply another filter") -> converge(c1) -> action(n9,"is there another filter to apply") -> branch(b2,XOR) -> action(n10,"continue with process if another filter to apply") -> converge(c2) -> action(n12,"is option to submit true") -> branch(b3,XOR) -> action(n14,"end process") -> end(e1)
